ed arrest at a French airport, though further details may evolve. Meanwhile, an article about royal exhibitions explored the shift of royal servants’ roles, from traditional duties like rat-catching to modern responsibilities amid evolving public expectations. A profile on Pope Francis acknowledged his measured response to England’s cautious approach in a recent sports-related context, while an analysis of Britain’s potential as a sci-tech leader emphasized the need for fiscal adjustments to unlock innovation. Additionally, coverage of the *Salvator Mundi* painting’s mysterious disappearance and the *Last of the Summer Wine* series were among recently amended pieces.\n\n**Section 4**\n* To ensure future accuracy, readers are encouraged to direct queries or corrections to the *Readers’ Editor* via **observer.readers@observer.co.uk**, postal mail at York Way, London N1 9GU, or by calling **020 3353 4736**.\n* A reminder that factual precision is prioritized across all publications, and readers play a key role in maintaining standards through their feedback.\n\n**P.P.S.** Always verify details before sharing or citing, as corrections may address nuances not immediately apparent in initial reporting.", "logprobs": [{"token": "**", "logprob": -0.36049768328666687}, {"token": "Section", "logprob": -0.004861558321863413}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -9.357491217087954e-05}, {"token": "1", "logprob": -0.0001510267611593008}, {"token": "**\n", "logprob": -0.18044239282608032}, {"token": "A", "logprob": -1.5793159008026123}, {"token": " recent", "logprob": -0.34346920251846313}, {"token": " correction", "logprob": -2.388509511947632}, {"token": " clar", "logprob": -1.2913568019866943}, {"token": "ifies", "logprob": -0.000587767455726862}, {"token": " that", "logprob": -0.29138481616973877}, {"token": " the", "logprob": -0.7705501317977905}, {"token": " new", "logprob": -0.6868627667427063}, {"token": " law", "logprob": -1.360581874847412}, {"token": " criminal", "logprob": -1.2